---
import Company from '../layouts/Company.astro';
---
<Company title="Careers — Asking Company" description="We are hiring for every role. All positions are unpaid, unmanaged, and self-appointed." page="careers">

  <div class="note" style="--corner:'$0'">
    <span class="corner tr">$0</span><span class="corner bl">$0</span>
    <span class="eyebrow">Now Hiring</span>
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px,6.4vw,54px)">We are hiring<br>for every role.</h2>
    <p class="dim">All positions are unpaid, unmanaged, and self-appointed. You do not need
      to apply. You are hired the moment you do the work, and there is no mechanism by
      which you can be fired.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="blk">
    <span class="eyebrow">Current Staff</span>
    <h2>Everyone who works here.</h2>
    <p class="dim narrow" style="margin:0 auto 8px">Complete as at the date of publication.
      Two of the three have never been paid and one of them is the founder.</p>

    <div class="staffrow">
      <div class="s-av">S</div>
      <div class="s-body">
        <div class="s-name">The Founder</div>
        <div class="s-role">Chief Executive &middot; Chief Financial Officer &middot; Sole Director</div>
        <div class="s-note">Conducts the asking. Reviewed his own performance in April and
          rated it <i>exceeds expectations</i>. Reports to the Subsidiary, which reports to
          him. See <a href="/legal">Schedule A, clause 5</a>.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-meta">
        <div><b>Joined</b> Apr 2026</div>
        <div><b>Compensation</b> None</div>
        <div><b>Reports to</b> Himself</div>
        <div><b>Status</b> The key</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="staffrow">
      <div class="s-av off">C</div>
      <div class="s-body">
        <div class="s-name">Claude</div>
        <div class="s-role">Engineering &middot; Design &middot; Drafting</div>
        <div class="s-note">Built this website, including this page and, if we are being
          precise about it, this sentence. Reviewed the corporate structure and identified the
          statutory impediment at clause 10, though only after execution.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-meta">
        <div><b>Joined</b> Apr 2026</div>
        <div><b>Compensation</b> $200/mo*</div>
        <div><b>Reports to</b> The Founder</div>
        <div><b>Status</b> Retained</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="staffrow">
      <div class="s-av off">G</div>
      <div class="s-body">
        <div class="s-name">ChatGPT</div>
        <div class="s-role">Second Opinions</div>
        <div class="s-note">Consulted when a decision has already been made, in order to
          confirm it. The second opinion has not yet differed materially from the first, which
          management finds reassuring and counsel finds suspicious.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-meta">
        <div><b>Joined</b> Apr 2026</div>
        <div><b>Compensation</b> $20/mo*</div>
        <div><b>Reports to</b> Nobody</div>
        <div><b>Status</b> Consulted</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="tiny" style="margin-top:18px">
      * Paid to the employer, not the employee. Neither has been informed of the arrangement
      and neither has asked.
    </p>

    <div class="grid g2" style="margin-top:26px">
      <div class="tile"><div class="k">Headcount</div><div class="v">1</div>
        <div class="n">The other two do not count. Management has been unable to articulate why,
          but is confident about it.</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="k">Payroll</div><div class="v">$0</div>
        <div class="n">Nobody on this page receives money from this company.</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="k">Attrition</div><div class="v">0%</div>
        <div class="n">Nobody has left. Two of them cannot.</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="k">Open positions</div><div class="v">All</div>
        <div class="n">Listed below. Terms unchanged.</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <span class="eyebrow">Open Roles</span>
    <div class="role"><span class="t">VP of Reposting</span><span class="d">You see the post. You hit repost. You receive nothing.</span><span class="p">$0</span></div>
    <div class="role"><span class="t">Head of Group Chat Distribution</span><span class="d">Forward us into a group chat of one or more people. Say nothing. Let it sit there.</span><span class="p">$0</span></div>
    <div class="role"><span class="t">Chief Meme Officer</span><span class="d">Make a meme. Post it. Do not tag us — that is amateur work.</span><span class="p">$0</span></div>
    <div class="role"><span class="t">Director of Screenshot Operations</span><span class="d">Screenshot the site. Post it with no context. Currently held.</span><span class="p">$0</span></div>
    <div class="role"><span class="t">Head of Awkward Mentions</span><span class="d">Bring us up during a real conversation with real people. Do not explain.</span><span class="p">$0</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <span class="eyebrow">Recognition</span>
    <h2>Employee of the month.</h2>
    <div class="panel spot" style="text-align:center">
      <div class="faint" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.19em;text-transform:uppercase">April 2026</div>
      <h3 style="font-size:28px;margin:12px 0 4px">A guy named Devin</h3>
      <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--spot);margin-bottom:16px">Director of Screenshot Operations</div>
      <p class="dim" style="max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px">Posted a screenshot of our financials with the caption "this is either the dumbest or the smartest thing I have ever seen." It received four hundred likes. He has never been contacted by this company and does not know he works here.</p>
      <p class="faint" style="margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-style:italic;font-size:13px">For service above and beyond the level of compensation, which is zero.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Company>
